Error [E-OSTARGET-BUILD-CONTEXT]: A `comptime if … == { … }` dispatch branches on `$build.os`
  --> tests/ui/os_target_build_context.jet:2:23
    |
  2 |     comptime if build.arch == {
    |                       ^^^^
 Why: `$build.os` is the one compiler-known value this dispatch folds on — it selects the arm matching the build's target OS at compile time
 Fix: Write `comptime if $build.os == { .Linux -> … .MacOS -> … .Windows -> … }`, or use a plain runtime `if` for a value that isn't known at compile time
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E-OSTARGET-BUILD-CONTEXT
